# Live win-rate overlay.
#
#   unset / empty   use the same-origin /api proxy (Cloudflare Pages Function)
#   <a full URL>    use that origin instead
#   off             disable entirely — no third-party requests
#
# Local `npm run dev` has no Pages Function, so the overlay reports
# "snapshot" unless you run `npx wrangler pages dev dist` instead.
VITE_LIVE_API=
